## Quick Access

### Get Cursor-Specific Guide
```
access_mcp_resource:
  server_name: mcp-abap-adt-1
  uri: agent-guide://cursor
```

### Get Universal Guide
See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) in repository root for:
- Complete resource and tool catalog
- Token-efficient workflow patterns
